        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Title Amount (RM) Parliament 113,140,000 Office of the Keeper of the Rulers’ Seal 2,130,000 National Audit Department 135,884,800 Election Commission 48,634,000 Public Services Commission 40,320,000 Prime Minister’s Department 4,922,469,000 Public Service Department 610,479,200 Attorney General’s Chambers 154,361,400 Malaysian Anti-Corruption Commission 216,220,000 Treasury 3,735,181,000 Treasury General Services 26,523,987,600 Contribution to Statutory Funds 1,927,400,100 Ministry of Foreign Affairs 526,046,000 Ministry of Plantation Industries and 161,283,500 Commodities Ministry of Agriculture and Agro-Based 3,058,976,100 Industry Ministry of Rural and Regional 3,218,079,700 Development Ministry of Natural Resources and 864,050,600 Environment Ministry of International Trade and 436,683,200 Industry Ministry of Domestic Trade, 577,700,000 Co-operatives and Consumerism Ministry of Works 964,390,000 Ministry of Transport 1,317,956,000 Ministry of Energy, Green Technology 98,660,000 and Water Purpose Title B. 30 Ministry of Science, Technology and Innovation B. 31 Ministry of Tourism and Culture B. 32 Ministry of the Federal Territories B. 40 Education Service Commission B. 42 Ministry of Health B. 43 Ministry of Urban Wellbeing, Housing and Local Government B. 45 Ministry of Youth and Sports B. 46 Ministry of Human Resources B. 47 Ministry of Communications and Multimedia B. 48 Ministry of Women, Family and Community Development B. 60 Ministry of Defence B. 62 Ministry of Home Affairs B. 63 Ministry of Education B. 64 Ministry of Higher Education TOTAL"
